{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "generated", "elements": [{"id": "laggnktbk19x4b11vs8d", "type": "frame", "x": 390, "y": 10, "width": 2470, "height": 1543.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#bbb", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0000", "roundness": null, "seed": 2017504764, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1238785980, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790867244655, "created": 1790867244655, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "System diagram"}, {"id": "ujOeHwdFcAefAZhnM6Jy", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 40, "width": 278.85, "height": 97.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0001", "roundness": null, "seed": 949539217, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200071089, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790867244655, "created": 1790867244655, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "REQUIREMENTS (ask 5, then move)\nPretrain, fine-tune or RL \u2014 one fleet?\nTotal GPUs, and the largest single job?\nOne region, or may a job span sites?\nWho submits, and the priority order?\nDone = a registered model version?", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "REQUIREMENTS (ask 5, then move)\nPretrain, fine-tune or RL \u2014 one fleet?\nTotal GPUs, and the largest single job?\nOne region, or may a job span sites?\nWho submits, and the priority order?\nDone = a registered model version?", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "IizHJIQgJlgSIMEGWC5w", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 171.5, "width": 286.0, "height": 113.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0002", "roundness": null, "seed": 1066984056, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 772092315, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790867244655, "created": 1790867244655, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A USER CAN\nSubmit a job: base model, GPU count,\ndataset, priority.\nStart only when every GPU is ready.\nWatch step, loss, throughput, failures.\nGet the trained model back, versioned.\nCancel and resume. Run many in parallel.", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "A USER CAN\nSubmit a job: base model, GPU count,\ndataset, priority.\nStart only when every GPU is ready.\nWatch step, loss, throughput, failures.\nGet the trained model back, versioned.\nCancel and resume. Run many in parallel.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "RpJG2Tr8hzUjEcPVJ2tR", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 319.25, "width": 314.6, "height": 130.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0003", "roundness": null, "seed": 2133201996, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1959386987, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790867244655, "created": 1790867244655, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "TECHNICAL CHALLENGES\nA job is a GANG: partial start is worthless.\nOne dead GPU kills the job, so effective\nMTBF falls linearly with job size.\nCheckpoint needs a barrier across ranks.\nFabric decides placement: cross-island\nall-reduce is taxed every step.\nIdle GPU = money burned.", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "TECHNICAL CHALLENGES\nA job is a GANG: partial start is worthless.\nOne dead GPU kills the job, so effective\nMTBF falls linearly with job size.\nCheckpoint needs a barrier across ranks.\nFabric decides placement: cross-island\nall-reduce is taxed every step.\nIdle GPU = money burned.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "efqReTtJQBS2v6wLEnrT", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 483.25, "width": 336.05, "height": 130.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0004", "roundness": null, "seed": 1708957521, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1679116189, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790867244655, "created": 1790867244655, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CORE ENTITIES\nTeam \u00b7 Job(gpus, dataset, priority, generation)\nAllocation(nodes, ranks, island, generation)\nNode(8 GPUs, pool, resident base models)\nCheckpoint(epoch, per-rank manifest, committed)\nDataset(shards, seed, cursor) \u00b7 Quota\nHealthEvent(node, gpu, class, ts)\nNOT entities: GPU alone, epoch, the weights", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CORE ENTITIES\nTeam \u00b7 Job(gpus, dataset, priority, generation)\nAllocation(nodes, ranks, island, generation)\nNode(8 GPUs, pool, resident base models)\nCheckpoint(epoch, per-rank manifest, committed)\nDataset(shards, seed, cursor) \u00b7 Quota\nHealthEvent(node, gpu, class, ts)\nNOT entities: GPU alone, epoch, the weights", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "4EkyriAIR9QxofjOaZlr", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 647.25, "width": 321.75, "height": 162.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0005", "roundness": null, "seed": 625675343, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1799361520, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790867244655, "created": 1790867244655, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "API\nPOST /jobs {base_model, gpus, dataset,\n  epochs, priority} -> job_id   (idempotent)\nGET /jobs/{id} -> state, epoch, step,\n  last committed checkpoint, restarts\nPOST /jobs/{id}/cancel | /resume\nGET /models/{name}/versions  <- deliverable\nInternal: /nodes/{id}/health \u00b7\n  /allocations/{id}/report {rank, generation}\n  POST /checkpoints  (commits the manifest)", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "API\nPOST /jobs {base_model, gpus, dataset,\n  epochs, priority} -> job_id   (idempotent)\nGET /jobs/{id} -> state, epoch, step,\n  last committed checkpoint, restarts\nPOST /jobs/{id}/cancel | /resume\nGET /models/{name}/versions  <- deliverable\nInternal: /nodes/{id}/health \u00b7\n  /allocations/{id}/report {rank, generation}\n  POST /checkpoints  (commits the manifest)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "HLth16OTC27QIyyDyl9B", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 843.75, "width": 278.85, "height": 130.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0006", "roundness": null, "seed": 472138490, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1460519318, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790867244655, "created": 1790867244655, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "WHAT BREAKS FIRST\nA 4,000-GPU job on 500 nodes at 6-month\nnode MTBF fails every ~9 HOURS.\nA 3-week run is interrupted ~50 times.\nRestart cost, not peak throughput,\nis the design driver.\nFail-slow is worse than fail-stop:\none straggler slows all 4,000 ranks.", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "WHAT BREAKS FIRST\nA 4,000-GPU job on 500 nodes at 6-month\nnode MTBF fails every ~9 HOURS.\nA 3-week run is interrupted ~50 times.\nRestart cost, not peak throughput,\nis the design driver.\nFail-slow is worse than fail-stop:\none straggler slows all 4,000 ranks.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "LgJH6MemxN7LDhE8DtiU", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 40, "width": 240, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f3f4f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0007", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1137122203, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2055665571, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "Zkb6GjHbG81RqwkVHWun"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "R9zAwfwuCRxGs7g4o2fq"}], "updated": 1790867244655, "created": 1790867244655, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "Zkb6GjHbG81RqwkVHWun", "type": "text", "x": 430, "y": 63.25, "width": 220, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0008", "roundness": null, "seed": 838145800, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1028162214, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790867244655, "created": 1790867244655, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Researcher\nsubmits a job", "fontSize": 15, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "LgJH6MemxN7LDhE8DtiU", "originalText": "Researcher\nsubmits a job", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "YToGwbbrqQ7B697wnomm", "type": "rectangle", "x": 900, "y": 40, "width": 240, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#dbeafe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "